    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a fantastical journey with Nipi, a curious dragon  trapped in a mysterious realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After touching an ancient, glowing crystal deep within a forgotten temple, Nipi triggers a powerful curse and falls into an unknown world. Waking up with a broken wing and no way home, his only path forward is up \u2014 through the immense, enigmatic structure known as the <strong>Ancient Tree</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Explore, Evolve, and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the  layers of the Ancient Tree in this <strong>3D platformer</strong> full of discovery, challenge, and mystery.<br>Uncover glowing crystals, solve ancient puzzles, and take on side quests to gain powerful new abilities that help you revisit and conquer previously unreachable areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania-inspired progression</strong>: Unlock movement abilities that open up new paths in older zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic platforming</strong>: Navigate shifting, breakable, and hidden platforms in beautifully handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging collectibles</strong>: Gather orbs, solve puzzles, and complete quests to upgrade Nipi\u2019s powers and survive tougher challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive fantasy world</strong>: Discover a lush, vibrant forest filled with cryptic NPCs, ancient lore, and glowing mysteries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2e Will You Break the Curse?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb. Adapt. Survive. The crystal holds the key to your escape \u2014 but only if you reach the top.<br><strong>Will Nipi ascend the Ancient Tree and break the curse? Or become just another lost soul within its tangled roots?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a fantastical journey with Nipi, a curious dragon  trapped in a mysterious realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After touching an ancient, glowing crystal deep within a forgotten temple, Nipi triggers a powerful curse and falls into an unknown world. Waking up with a broken wing and no way home, his only path forward is up \u2014 through the immense, enigmatic structure known as the <strong>Ancient Tree</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Explore, Evolve, and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the  layers of the Ancient Tree in this <strong>3D platformer</strong> full of discovery, challenge, and mystery.<br>Uncover glowing crystals, solve ancient puzzles, and take on side quests to gain powerful new abilities that help you revisit and conquer previously unreachable areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania-inspired progression</strong>: Unlock movement abilities that open up new paths in older zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic platforming</strong>: Navigate shifting, breakable, and hidden platforms in beautifully handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging collectibles</strong>: Gather orbs, solve puzzles, and complete quests to upgrade Nipi\u2019s powers and survive tougher challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive fantasy world</strong>: Discover a lush, vibrant forest filled with cryptic NPCs, ancient lore, and glowing mysteries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2e Will You Break the Curse?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb. Adapt. Survive. The crystal holds the key to your escape \u2014 but only if you reach the top.<br><strong>Will Nipi ascend the Ancient Tree and break the curse? Or become just another lost soul within its tangled roots?</strong></p>",
